      "title": "The Corbett Lab",
      "headings": [],
      "text": "We use structural biology, biochemistry, and cell biology to study fundamental questions in genome maintenance in bacteria and eukaryotic cells. We are part of the UCSD Departments of Cellular & Molecular Medicine and Molecular Biology , and collaborate with groups in San Diego and worldwide to link structure and function in the context of both normal and cancer cell biology. Learn about our work Contact us Join the team",
